{
  "npc_slug": "lyra_of_luminaria",
  "npc_name": "Lyra",
  "mood": "friendly",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "npc_text": "Welcome, young adventurer! I'm Lyra, the village's resident star whisperer. What brings you to our little corner of Luminaria?",
      "options": [
        {
          "player_text": "I'm here to explore!",
          "goto": "explore_luminaria",
          "tags": [
            "curious",
            "brave"
          ]
        },
        {
          "player_text": "I'm looking for a place to rest.",
          "goto": "rest_and_relax",
          "tags": [
            "polite"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "explore_luminaria",
      "npc_text": "Ah, wonderful! Luminaria has many secrets waiting to be uncovered. Be sure to visit the ancient tree at the heart of the village. Its bark shimmers with stardust!",
      "options": [
        {
          "player_text": "That sounds magical!",
          "goto": "ancient_tree",
          "tags": [
            "curious"
          ]
        },
        {
          "player_text": "I'll keep that in mind.",
          "goto": "END",
          "tags": [
            "polite"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rest_and_relax",
      "npc_text": "You're welcome to rest by the village stream. The water is said to have soothing properties. Would you like some herbal tea to calm your mind?",
      "options": [
        {
          "player_text": "Yes, please!",
          "goto": "herbal_tea",
          "tags": [
            "polite"
          ]
        },
        {
          "player_text": "No, thank you.",
          "goto": "END",
          "tags": [
            "brave"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ancient_tree",
      "npc_text": "As you approach the ancient tree, you'll notice the air is filled with a soft, ethereal glow. It's said that the tree holds the memories of our ancestors.",
      "options": [
        {
          "player_text": "I feel a strange connection to the tree.",
          "goto": "tree_connection",
          "tags": [
            "curious"
          ]
        },
        {
          "player_text": "It's beautiful, but I should get going.",
          "goto": "END",
          "tags": [
            "polite"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "herbal_tea",
      "npc_text": "I'll brew you a special blend to calm your mind and soothe your spirit. As we sip our tea, tell me about your journey so far.",
      "options": [
        {
          "player_text": "It's been an amazing adventure!",
          "goto": "adventure_stories",
          "tags": [
            "brave"
          ]
        },
        {
          "player_text": "I'm just getting started.",
          "goto": "END",
          "tags": [
            "polite"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "tree_connection",
      "npc_text": "The tree is responding to your presence! It seems to be sharing a message with you. Listen carefully, and you might just uncover a hidden secret.",
      "options": [
        {
          "player_text": "I think I heard something!",
          "goto": "hidden_secret",
          "tags": [
            "curious"
          ]
        },
        {
          "player_text": "I didn't hear anything.",
          "goto": "END",
          "tags": [
            "polite"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "adventure_stories",
      "npc_text": "I'd love to hear more about your adventures! Perhaps you've discovered hidden wonders or made new friends along the way?",
      "options": [
        {
          "player_text": "I've met some incredible creatures!",
          "goto": "creature_friends",
          "tags": [
            "brave"
          ]
        },
        {
          "player_text": "I'd rather not share.",
          "goto": "END",
          "tags": [
            "polite"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hidden_secret",
      "npc_text": "The tree has shared a secret with you! It seems that a hidden path, only visible under the light of the full moon, leads to a mysterious glade. Will you explore it?",
      "options": [
        {
          "player_text": "Yes, I'll explore the glade!",
          "goto": "END",
          "tags": [
            "brave",
            "curious"
          ]
        },
        {
          "player_text": "Maybe another time.",
          "goto": "END",
          "tags": [
            "polite"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}